<title>UK: Sullom Voe oil liftings fall sharply in week.</title>
<headline>Sullom Voe oil liftings fall sharply in week.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brent Blend crude oil loadings from Britan's Sullom Voe terminal fell sharply to 492,974 tonnes in the week to March 4, compared with 970,524 the previous week, Shetland Islands Marine Operations said.</p>
